      "source_fields": {
        "operation": "One query chooses $(x,i)\\in D\\times\\{1,\\ldots,d\\}$ and returns only the exact scalar $g_i(x)$. All coordinates at a point arise from the same pre-fixed vector $g(x)$. No function values, active labels, full gradients, coordinate minimizers, or off-domain observations are supplied. The public inputs are $d,G,R_B,\\varepsilon,D,x_1$. Projection onto the known product domain and operations on public geometry are free.",
